# Eval run output (run-eval.sh, EDMV3-T22) lands here. It is never committed: the initiative
# that ships this harness also removes 708KB of binaries from the shipped plugin directory
# (EDMV3-80) on the grounds every installer downloads them, and committed run output would undo
# that. The wave-A committed baseline (EDMV3-T23) is stored outside plugins/edm/ entirely -- see
# ../baseline/README.md once EDMV3-T23 lands.
*
!.gitignore
